      "output": {
        "status": "success",
        "rationale": "The reviewed tests cover each observable obligation of `requirements.sdk.graph.agent-harness.fixed_tools`.\n\n**Tool set supplied**\n- `agent/tests.rs#fn[default_tool_accepts_scalar_results_and_keeps_the_exact_prefix]` asserts the exact tool list when no sources are attached: `read_node`, `outgoing_edges`, `get_next_page`, `submit_result`. It also asserts the `get_next_page` schema.\n- `agent/configured.rs#mod[tests]/fn[configured_agent_uses_domain_source_tools_in_independent_executions]` asserts the full list when sources are attached. The source tools are `list_sources`, `outline_source`, `search_text`, `search_structure` and `finish_search`.\n- The same test asserts that `read_node`, `outline_source` and `outgoing_edges` take an integer `node`.\n- `supplied_openai_backend_runs_independent_calls_against_a_local_transport` checks the tool list over a local transport.\n\n**Graph tools invoke the graph and contents interfaces**\n- `agent_edge_tools_record_selections_without_validating_targets` checks `outgoing_edges` against the graph's edge lookups. It checks the targets returned, rejection of a malformed node ID, and that no lookup happens on a malformed node.\n- `graph_tools_record_delivered_snapshots_and_prepared_pages_do_not_record_delivery` checks `read_node` and `get_next_page` against the contents interface.\n- `queued_contents_and_graph_read_tools_redact_credentials_before_delivery` checks that read contents are redacted.\n\n**Source tools invoke the source interfaces and source-node mapping**\n- `configured_agent_uses_domain_source_tools_in_independent_executions` runs `list_sources`. It maps a listed file node through `read_node`, and the result is the domain's snapshot rather than disk contents. It also covers `search_text`, `finish_search` (including unknown and repeated tags) and a rejected invalid node.\n- `structural_tags_select_only_the_original_enclosing_item` covers `search_structure`, the mapping of hits to enclosing-item nodes, and finishing a search.\n- `outline_continuations_keep_the_file_and_complete_ordered_items` covers `outline_source` and `get_next_page`, including paged reads of a source root.\n\n**Input-recording policy**\n- Delivered reads and edge selections are recorded as dependencies. Prepared but undelivered inputs are not. The assertions are `prepared_inputs` against `delivered_inputs`, the failed-delivery cases, and the dependency lists.\n- Listings and rejected calls record nothing.\n- Finished searches record only the selected tags, and a repeated finish does not record twice.\n\n**`read_node` accepts every domain node kind**\n- `read_node_advertises_and_reads_every_domain_id_variant` uses a test domain whose `LookupNode` has two variants, `Requirement` and `Selection`.\n- It reads both through `read_node` and asserts the output equals each node's formatted content. It also asserts the recorded dependencies and the `node` parameter schema.\n\nI found no untested obligation and no marking gap."
